{"id":"reference/Vectors","kind":"langref","title":"向量","sourceUrl":"https://ziglang.org/documentation/0.17.0/#Vectors","file":"reference/Vectors.json","headings":[{"depth":2,"slug":"Vectors","text":"向量"},{"depth":3,"slug":"Relationship-with-Arrays","text":"与数组的关系"},{"depth":3,"slug":"Destructuring-Vectors","text":"向量解构"}],"html":"<h2 id=\"Vectors\" class=\"chapter-anchor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Vectors/#Vectors\">向量</a></h2>\n\n      <p>向量是一组并行处理的布尔值、<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Integers/#Integers\">整数</a>、<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Floats/#Floats\">浮点数</a>或<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Pointers/#Pointers\">指针</a>，条件允许时使用 SIMD 指令。向量类型通过内置函数 <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Builtin-Functions/#Vector\">@Vector</a> 创建。</p>\n      <p>向量通常支持与其基础类型相同的内置运算符。唯一例外是布尔向量上的 <code><span class=\"tok-kw\">and</span></code> 和 <code><span class=\"tok-kw\">or</span></code> 关键字，因为它们会影响控制流，而向量不允许这样做。其他运算均按元素执行，并返回与输入向量等长的向量，包括：</p>\n      <ul>\n          <li>算术运算（<code>+</code>、<code>-</code>、<code>/</code>、<code>*</code>、<code><span class=\"tok-builtin\">@divFloor</span></code>、<code><span class=\"tok-builtin\">@sqrt</span></code>、<code><span class=\"tok-builtin\">@ceil</span></code>、<code><span class=\"tok-builtin\">@log</span></code> 等）</li>\n          <li>按位运算符（<code>&gt;&gt;</code>、<code>&lt;&lt;</code>、<code>&amp;</code>、<code>|</code>、<code>~</code> 等）</li>\n          <li>比较运算符（<code>&lt;</code>、<code>&gt;</code>、<code>==</code> 等）</li>\n          <li>布尔非（<code>!</code>）</li>\n      </ul>\n      <p>禁止在同一次数学运算中混用标量（单个数值）和向量。Zig 提供 <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Builtin-Functions/#splat\">@splat</a> 内置函数，便于将标量转换为向量；也支持通过 <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Builtin-Functions/#reduce\">@reduce</a> 和数组索引语法将向量转换为标量。向量还支持与长度在编译时已知的定长数组相互赋值。</p>\n      <p>要在向量内部或向量之间重排元素，Zig 提供 <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Builtin-Functions/#shuffle\">@shuffle</a> 和 <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Builtin-Functions/#select\">@select</a> 函数。</p>\n      <p>短于目标机器原生 SIMD 宽度的向量运算通常编译为单条 SIMD 指令，更长的向量则编译为多条 SIMD 指令。如果目标架构没有对应运算的 SIMD 支持，编译器默认逐个处理向量元素。Zig 支持编译时已知且不超过 2^32-1 的任意向量长度，不过通常使用较小的二次幂长度（2–64）。注意，过长的向量（例如 2^20）在当前 Zig 版本中可能导致编译器崩溃。</p>\n      <div class=\"expressive-code\"><figure class=\"frame has-title\"><figcaption class=\"header\"><span class=\"title\">test_vector.zig</span></figcaption><pre data-language=\"zig\" data-code-frame=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">std</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">@import</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--0:#032F62;--1:#9ECBFF\">\"std\"</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">);</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">expectEqual</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">std</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">testing</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">expectEqual</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">;</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">test</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#032F62;--1:#9ECBFF\">\"Basic vector usage\"</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span class=\"indent\">    </span><span style=\"--0:#616972;--1:#99A0A6\">// 向量的长度和基础类型在编译时已知。</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span class=\"indent\">    </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">a</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">@Vector</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">i32</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">){ </span><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span class=\"indent\">    </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">b</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">@Vector</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">i32</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">){ </span><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">6</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">7</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">8</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span class=\"indent\">    </span><span style=\"--0:#616972;--1:#99A0A6\">// 数学运算按元素进行。</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span class=\"indent\">    </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">c</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">a</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">b</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">;</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span class=\"indent\">    </span><span style=\"--0:#616972;--1:#99A0A6\">// 可以使用数组索引语法访问单个向量元素。</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span class=\"indent\">    </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">try</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#6F42C1;--1:#B392F0\">expectEqual</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">6</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">c</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">]);</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span class=\"indent\">    </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">try</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#6F42C1;--1:#B392F0\">expectEqual</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">8</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">c</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">]);</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span class=\"indent\">    </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">try</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#6F42C1;--1:#B392F0\">expectEqual</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">c</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">]);</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span class=\"indent\">    </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">try</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#6F42C1;--1:#B392F0\">expectEqual</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">12</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">c</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">]);</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">}</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">test</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#032F62;--1:#9ECBFF\">\"Conversion between vectors, arrays, and slices\"</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span class=\"indent\">    </span><span style=\"--0:#616972;--1:#99A0A6\">// 向量可以强制转换为数组，反之亦然。</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span class=\"indent\">    </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">arr1</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">]</span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">f32</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">_</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">]</span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">f32</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">{ </span><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">1.1</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">3.2</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">4.5</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">5.6</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span class=\"indent\">    </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">vec</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">@Vector</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">f32</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">arr1</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">;</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span class=\"indent\">    </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">arr2</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">]</span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">f32</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">vec</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">;</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span class=\"indent\">    </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">try</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#6F42C1;--1:#B392F0\">expectEqual</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">arr1</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">arr2</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">);</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span class=\"indent\">    </span><span style=\"--0:#616972;--1:#99A0A6\">// 也可以使用 .* 将编译时已知长度的切片赋值给向量</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span class=\"indent\">    </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">vec2</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">@Vector</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">f32</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">arr1</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">..</span><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">].</span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">;</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span class=\"indent\">    </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">slice</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">: []</span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">f32</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">&amp;</span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">arr1</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">;</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span class=\"indent\">    </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">var</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">offset</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">u32</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F9758